    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, an ammonia-level emergency? thats kinda intense. i just thought it was bad soil. what do u mean by that? like, how do i tell if it's the ammonia thing vs just needing more nutrients? and is there a specific way to test for it without buying a whole lab kit?",
